[[31,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>It is not possible to order a\nsingle lock barrel or to order barrels simply by using a part code.\nWhen ordering barrels, observe the special procedure set out in\n5580E - Special accessories.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025733\">7015A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025742\">7015B10</a></p><p>1. Remove the retaining clip.</p><p>2. Insert the key in the lock barrel and remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005202.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the lock barrel\nis undamaged.</p><p>Fit the retaining spring into its seat.</p><p>Fit the lock barrel into its seat until\nthe groove engages with the retaining clips.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025742\">7015B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025733\">7015A04</a></p>"]]